expansive_types.velt:13:13: error: `L<T>` refers to itself at a growing type argument (`L<T[]>`), so `JSON.parse` cannot read it
Velt compiles each instantiation of a type separately, and each `L<T>` needs one with a longer type argument, without end (TypeScript accepts the type); give the member a type that does not grow, or a `JsonValue`
